      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "### Godot version\n\n4.0-beta9\n\n### System information\n\nFedora Workstation 36\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere's been a regression between betas 8 and 9 where setting a minimum size via `DisplayServer.window_set_min_size` doesn't seem to have any effect.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I seem to be able to shrink the window down past the normal minimum size of 64x64.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCall `DisplayServer.window_set_min_size`; note that the window can be resized down past the given size.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project\n\nTrivial.",
